{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415759","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415759","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041575901:0":{"text":"没想到还能再见到你。","source_cn":"没想到还能再见到你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A191BAD1F11F51C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041575902:0":{"text":"彼此。","source_cn":"彼此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x354BE04259F64BC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041575903:0":{"text":"雅库伯尔近来如何？","source_cn":"雅库伯尔近来如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1608E65D6BF8599","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041575904:0":{"text":"若你真心在意雅库伯尔，就该回归故土，守卫这里。","source_cn":"若你真心在意雅库伯尔，就该回归故土，守卫这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6A8211B17A0CAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041575905:0":{"text":"你是猎血节的勇士，拥有神赐之力，护卫雅库伯尔本该是你的使命！","source_cn":"你是猎血节的勇士，拥有神赐之力，护卫雅库伯尔本该是你的使命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x588723DB5530FB25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041575906:0":{"text":"看看雅库伯尔在你的统治下变成了什么样子吧。强者与弱者敌对，没