ndex":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1041575927:0":{"text":"你所谓的强者和弱者，在我看来都是平等的。无论如何也不该为了其中一方而牺牲另一方。","source_cn":"你所谓的强者和弱者，在我看来都是平等的。无论如何也不该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A3F76863DBE7A1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1041575928:1":{"text":"你不是首领，可以持中不言。但我不行。","source_cn":"你不是首领，可以持中不言。但我不行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8C9B539FE770593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1041575929:1":{"text":"或许我会因自己的选择而成为另一些人眼中的罪人，但雅库伯尔必须撑过这段最艰难的时期。哪怕分裂，总好过走向灭亡！","source_cn":"或许我会因自己的选择而成为另一些人眼中的罪人，但雅库伯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BB4062E2B3D7565","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1041575930:1":{"text":"到时候，你也好，加拉也罢。谁来取代我，如何评判我，随便你们。","source_cn":"到时候，你也好，加拉也罢。谁来取代我，如何评判我，随便你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80E4B9D4B1275A5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1041575931:1":{"text":"……我无法认同你的理念。","source_cn":"……我无法认同你的理念。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A4E277D17AAD931","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_titl